cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Simulation code for: Velocity of a Quantum Particle in a Classically Forbidden Region"
abstract: >-
  GPU (CuPy) split-step simulation of a Gaussian wavepacket scattering off a
  potential step in a coupled double-well waveguide, with Bohmian-trajectory
  integration and dwell-time analysis. Produces the figures of the accompanying
  paper by C. Beck, S. Goldstein, D. Lazarovici, R. Tumulka and N. Zanghi.
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-07-30"
authors:
  - family-names: Lazarovici
    given-names: Dustin
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1484-1172"
    affiliation: "Technion - Israel Institute of Technology"
keywords:
  - Bohmian mechanics
  - dwell time
  - tunneling
  - evanescent waves
  - coupled waveguides
